  "_note": "Disabled-by-default campaign automation (brief \u00a79, \u00a713). dispatchEnabled stays false until the owner authorizes sending AND every send gate passes. Suppression (unsubscribe, hard bounce, complaint, purchase, open support case, loss of eligibility) overrides every step immediately.",
